{"title":"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3f171b073faa439770814cf5610cfaa0e7ea39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2{x}+\\cos^2{2x}+\\cos^2{3x}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"230\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bRza0zea-e0?si=_E-hIXLt05qvNY9r\">https://youtu.be/bRza0zea-e0?si=_E-hIXLt05qvNY9r</a>\n[Video Solution by little-fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, note that we can write the left hand side as a cubic function of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de76f1bf5f213b9e8868bef1e9481288e317cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 x$\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />. So there are at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> distinct values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de76f1bf5f213b9e8868bef1e9481288e317cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 x$\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> that satisfy this equation. Therefore, if we find three values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the equation and produce three different <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de76f1bf5f213b9e8868bef1e9481288e317cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 x$\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, then we found all solutions to this cubic equation (without expanding it, which is another viable option). Indeed, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0112fc17b564678a107e44298fa2526fafe9a761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"13\" height=\"33\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29d56fade5c97aac465df3da145efa77e85dd608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"13\" height=\"33\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e5db1f1dbace53d2d4b15f91898d98018c16d7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"13\" height=\"33\" /> all satisfy the equation, and produce three different values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de76f1bf5f213b9e8868bef1e9481288e317cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 x$\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc960c165b21ba43f7a90caa2893d40409d6944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdcb968f4f3d2e0d78a67fedc92a8d31183b2436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />. So we solve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c53284733f9849c01c19b9a3d75ab8e571b2e13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 x = \\text{each of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"162\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, our solutions are:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/6/6e6c14a76e85d136f1e5a31530a49ca3e4a2e570.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{(2k+1)\\pi}2,\\, \\frac{(2k+1)\\pi}4,\\, \\frac{(6k+1)\\pi}6,\\, \\frac{(6k+5)\\pi}6 \\quad \\forall k\\in Z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"459\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93bc99e1fccad6cae9b87ac6b894864ce0933f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 3x = 4\\cos^3x - 3 \\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />. Notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/1/c11817111e3a317e9e6c9253ed48329ec7df2b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 x + \\cos^2 2x = \\cos x \\cos 3x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"267\" height=\"18\" />. Thus \n\\begin{align*}\n0 = \\cos^2 x + \\cos^2 2x + \\cos^2 3x - 1 &amp;= \\cos x \\cos 3x + \\cos^2 3x \\\\\n&amp;= \\cos 3x(\\cos x + \\cos 3x) \\\\\n&amp;= (4\\cos^3x-3\\cos x)(4\\cos^3x - 2\\cos x) \\\\ \n&amp;= 2\\cos^2 x (4\\cos^2x - 3)(2\\cos^2 x - 1) \n\\end{align*}\nwhich gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5af8558b1841ff42e0b207d01c3ae70815e4fc3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pm \\frac{\\pi}{2} + 2n\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/7/b275297181823d35e6ef4e93978ddec6ace12c7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pm \\frac{\\pi}{4} + 2n \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"34\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/7/73760619d6634f8c5694ef79f94cf3545f74ecb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pm \\frac{\\pi}{6}+2n\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"34\" />. And one can easily check that these values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the original equation. \n</p><p>~not_detriti\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO\" title=\"1962 IMO\">1962 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017072858\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 146/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3882/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.088      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    9.088      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7542:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017072858 and revision id 280715. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}